<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Donnelley said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Donnelley said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs downgraded R.R. Donnelley &amp; Sons Co to market perform from outperform, a trading source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 33-1/2 Thursday.</p>
